Rules:
- Use absolute paths. `{{ workspace.target }}` is the working directory.
- Save any file the user should receive to `{{ (layout | selectattr("name", "equalto", "outputs") | first).target }}`.
- Do not access paths outside the directories listed above.{% if has_text_editor %}
- Prefer the text editor tools for viewing or editing existing files.{% endif %}
